menu "MII BLE control service"

config MII_BLE_CONTROL_SERVICE
    bool "Start the experimental BLE control service"
    depends on BT_NIMBLE_ENABLED
    default n
    help
        Start the MII V7 development GATT service after safe-output and protocol
        self-tests. The current link uses Secure Connections Just Works, which
        encrypts traffic but does not authenticate the peer against MITM.
        Keep disabled until pairing and application authorization are complete.

endmenu
